  "cara_baca_pembanding": "Both blocks use the same three models, metric, and paired protocol, and only the place of the difference changes. When the difference is in the profile metadata, the pairwise rate stays near 0.5. When it is in the text, the rate rises on all three models, most on zerank-2. So the scoring setup can detect a difference, and it does not explain the null on the metadata channel.",
